e/11872126/screencap/6a6a16e3b7fe3.jpg","released":"2026-08-01T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt37532893:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"6. Revelaciones","overview":"Al enfrentarse a su hermano, Reiji rememora su pasado, mientras que Jiro y Rago lidian con algo más fuerte.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11872127/screencap/6a73bba39dd02.jpg","released":"2026-08-08T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt37532893:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"7. 3 contra tres","overview":"Un nuevo caso lleva a los miembros de Black Torch a enfrentarse a tres mononoke.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11872128/screencap/6a7dd9f14bc94.jpg","released":"2026-08-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt37532893:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"8. Contra todo pronóstico","overview":"Ichika regresa con su objetivo capturado y Jiro desintegra al suyo, pero Reiji tiene ante él a su hermano.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11872129/screencap/6a88813d410a1.jpg","released":"2026-08-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt37532893:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"9. Uno","overview":"La Primera División Especial captura a Jiro bajo las órdenes de Kusumi, pero no será un prisionero fácil.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11872130/screencap/6a92172c2a7b8.jpg","released":"2026-08-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt37532893:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"10. Técnicas letales","overview":"Jiro se adentra en el Bosque Eclíptico para intentar entender y dominar el poder de Rago en su interior.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11872131/screencap/6a9b66733398e.jpg","released":"2026-09-05T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"24 min"},{"id":"tt37532893:1:11","season":1,"episode":11,"title":"11. Blanco o negro","overview":"Jiro regresa de su corto pero intenso entrenamiento mientras que Rago aprende el origen